## Software Development Model

<!-- UPDATE:START -->
The development of SecureCAT follows the AI-Driven Development Lifecycle (AIDLC), a software engineering framework that replaces traditional human-only development models with structured AI-human collaboration workflows (Addla, 2026; Raja, 2025). Traditional lifecycles, such as the Rapid Application Development (RAD) model, were formulated for human-only team dynamics and do not account for the code generation and testing patterns characteristic of current software development (Raja, 2025). In c
<!-- UPDATE:END -->
