## Data Analysis

<!-- UPDATE:START -->
The data analysis procedures for this study will follow the three specific research objectives, each paired with an analytical approach suited to the type of data it generates. For the first specific objective, which seeks to identify existing admission testing processes, operational gaps, and coordination requirements at ISPSC Tagudin, qualitative thematic analysis will be applied to the interview transcripts gathered from the Registrar staff, Guidance staff, and Campus Director, as well as to
<!-- UPDATE:END -->
